    <sys:String x:Key="str.Tip.Export.DumpAll">Stream every class + property + function (including BPGCs) to a JSON Lines file. Used by scripts/analysis/analyze_dumps.py to derive keyword tables / class bonuses / threshold calibration from real-game data. ~30-60s per game; output is 50-500 MB depending on game size.</sys:String>
